# This directory holds the all-MiniLM-L6-v2 ONNX model used by LocalEmbeddingProvider.
#
# Model variant: Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 — INT8 dynamic-quantized ONNX
# Source URL:    https://huggingface.co/Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2/resolve/main/onnx/model_quantized.onnx
# Local filename: model.onnx  (saved as model.onnx regardless of source filename)
# Size:          ~22 MB  (22,972,370 bytes)
# SHA256:        afdb6f1a0e45b715d0bb9b11772f032c399babd23bfc31fed1c170afc848bdb1
# License:       Apache 2.0
# Output:        384-dimensional L2-normalised float32 embedding vectors
# Inputs:        input_ids (int64), attention_mask (int64), token_type_ids (int64)
#
# The model binary (model.onnx) is NOT committed to git — see root .gitignore.
#
# Local development:
#   Run the application once — LocalEmbeddingProvider downloads the quantized model
#   (~22 MB) from HuggingFace CDN to ~/.onenest/models/all-MiniLM-L6-v2/model.onnx.
#   Subsequent restarts skip the download entirely.
#
# Docker / Render:
#   The Dockerfile downloads model_quantized.onnx at docker build time,
#   verifies its SHA256, and saves it as /app/models/all-MiniLM-L6-v2/model.onnx.
#   No HuggingFace access is required at container startup.
